      "created_at": "2025-02-19T17:20:47.034Z",
      "cooked": "<p>did you get any error during <strong>India Compliance</strong> app installation on site?</p>\n<p>Follow these steps to fix this issue:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><code>bench get-app --branch version-15 https://github.com/resilient-tech/india-compliance.git</code>   change version whatever you what version-14 or 15 .</li>\n<li><code>bench --site site_name install-app india-compliance</code></li>\n<li><code>bench --site site_name migrate</code></li>\n<li><code>bench restart</code></li>\n</ol>",
